====== ASUS RT-AC56U and RT-AC56R ======

[[wp>IEEE 802.11ac]] capable device from 2013. **wifi 802.11ac support is missing**

RT-AC56R and RT-AC56R are the same device and both will work with the same firmware image, the name difference is only related to commercial packaging. See  [[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/upcycling-asus-rt-ac56r/102343|forum thread]] for more details.

