^ SoC        | Broadcom BCM4708A0 (ARM Cortex A9@800 MHz)               |
^ Flash      | 128 MiB (Spansion?)                                      |
^ RAM        | 256MiB ESMT M15F2G16128A                                 |
^ Wireless   | Broadcom BCM43217 for bgn + Broadcom BCM4352 for ac/an   |
^ USB        | 2x (USB 3.0, USB 2.0)                                    |


